flowchart LR
    A[Owner-approved independent sampling and privacy plan] --> B[Independent source collection]
    B --> C[De-identify and assign opaque IDs]
    C --> D[Blind annotator 1]
    C --> E[Blind annotator 2]
    D --> F[Lock both labels before comparison]
    E --> F
    F --> G[Record every disagreement]
    G --> H[Independent adjudication or unresolved status]
    H --> I[Freeze gold / schema / split / hashes before runs]
    I --> J{Separate budget and consent approval}
    J -- absent --> K[Blocked: no live call or audio collection]
    J -- present --> L[Bounded sequential live evaluation]
    L --> M[Retain failures and missing measurements]
    M --> N[Report per-language metrics / cost / ASR separately]
